{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Redline Express \u2013 a high-pressure parcel sorting &amp; inspecting simulator, where efficiency is survival and mistakes are... suspicious.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the reinforced boots of a warehouse operator working behind the Iron Curtain. Every package matters. Every decision is logged. And sometimes (always), the inspector watches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd27 Key Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soviet-inspired Sorting Simulation \u2013 Sort, search, inspect and ship thousands of state-controlled parcels with precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sort Together \u2013 Sort side by side with 3 comrades</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic Inspections \u2013 Handle unannounced visits from officials. Survive audits, inspections, and surprise interrogations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Facility Expansion \u2013 Unlock better equipment, and optimize the flow\u2026 or jam the system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sabotage System \u2013Choose whether to report or cover up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cold War Narrative Layer \u2013 Receive daily memos, radio broadcasts, secret letters and strange packages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Moral Choices \u2013 Will you follow orders or question the system?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f In development</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a work in progress. Our goal is to deliver a gritty, mechanical gameplay loop wrapped in narrative tension. Expect surprises, inspections, and loads of raporting</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd14 Wishlist today</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your loyalty will be noted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Error rates exceeding 2.7% will be treated as sabotage. Glory to the Party.&quot;</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Error rates exceeding 2.7% will be treated as sabotage. Glory to the Line.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014 Internal Memo #178B, Department of Postal Integrity</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333500/extras/e92a7ad8fef8d4f90e5f30cb53e73caf.avif?t=1771346243\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333500/extras_big/e92a7ad8fef8d4f90e5f30cb53e73caf.avif?t=1771346243 width=1560 height=2340 /></span></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3333500?t=1771346243","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3333500?t=1771346243","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333500/bcf55a93f7f4385a939baafb06e3746e534b539d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771346243","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333500/bcf55a93f7f4385a939baafb06e3746e534b539d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771346243","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Game aims to show the absurds of communism political system. It's something like cold war simulator. It will be more likely be packed with slogans like \"work, sort obey\" etc. We are not planning to show any acts of violence. The alcohol, weapons and so on will be present in game, but as contrabanda objects, which should be properly maintained by player. No killing or sexual acts.\r\n\r\nWe're planning to add some gulag references for being disobedient"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Redline Express \u2013 a high-pressure parcel sorting &amp; inspecting simulator, where efficiency is survival and mistakes are... suspicious.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the reinforced boots of a warehouse operator working behind the Iron Curtain. Every package matters. Every decision is logged. And sometimes (always), the inspector watches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd27 Key Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soviet-inspired Sorting Simulation \u2013 Sort, search, inspect and ship thousands of state-controlled parcels with precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sort Together \u2013 Sort side by side with 3 comrades</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic Inspections \u2013 Handle unannounced visits from officials. Survive audits, inspections, and surprise interrogations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Facility Expansion \u2013 Unlock better equipment, and optimize the flow\u2026 or jam the system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sabotage System \u2013Choose whether to report or cover up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cold War Narrative Layer \u2013 Receive daily memos, radio broadcasts, secret letters and strange packages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Moral Choices \u2013 Will you follow orders or question the system?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f In development</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a work in progress. Our goal is to deliver a gritty, m